{
  "videoId": "media:2d3be2fb14cf02734e71494824e2102b",
  "url": "https://images-assets.nasa.gov/video/What%20is%20a%20NASA%20Spinoff/What%20is%20a%20NASA%20Spinoff~mobile.mp4",
  "title": "What is a NASA Spinoff",
  "language": "en",
  "origin": "creator-captions",
  "producer": "publisher-subtitles",
  "recordedAt": "2026-11-15",
  "source": "https://images-assets.nasa.gov/video/What%20is%20a%20NASA%20Spinoff/What%20is%20a%20NASA%20Spinoff.srt",
  "segments": [
    {
      "startSec": 0.5,
      "endSec": 2.866,
      "text": "What is a NASA spinoff?"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 3.536,
      "endSec": 6.305,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Technologist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 6.3,
      "endSec": 7.9,
      "text": "Well, to answer that question,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 7.9,
      "endSec": 11.033,
      "text": "we’re going to have to go all the way back to 1958,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 11.333,
      "endSec": 12.5,
      "text": "back to the legislation"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 12.5,
      "endSec": 13.533,
      "text": "that originally created"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 13.533,
      "endSec": 15.6,
      "text": "the space agency, NASA."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 15.6,
      "endSec": 17.3,
      "text": "So in that legislation,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 17.3,
      "endSec": 20.1,
      "text": "there's some forward-looking language that says,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 20.1,
      "endSec": 21.7,
      "text": "“Make sure that all the cool stuff"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 21.7,
      "endSec": 23.4,
      "text": "you develop for space"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 23.4,
      "endSec": 24.833,
      "text": "doesn't just get blasted off"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 24.833,
      "endSec": 25.6,
      "text": "into the universe,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 25.6,
      "endSec": 26.2,
      "text": "but comes back"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 26.2,
      "endSec": 27.033,
      "text": "down to the Earth"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 27.033,
      "endSec": 28.4,
      "text": "in the form of practical"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 28.4,
      "endSec": 30,
      "text": "and terrestrial benefits.”"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 30,
      "endSec": 31.3,
      "text": "I'm paraphrasing, of course."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 31.3,
      "endSec": 32.933,
      "text": "The legislation is actually a little bit dry"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 32.933,
      "endSec": 34.233,
      "text": "like legislation should be."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 34.9,
      "endSec": 37.5,
      "text": "Since that time, NASA has worked"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 37.5,
      "endSec": 38.6,
      "text": "to get the technologies"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 38.6,
      "endSec": 40.833,
      "text": "it created into the hands of the public."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 40.833,
      "endSec": 43.833,
      "text": "These become products and services"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 43.9,
      "endSec": 46.833,
      "text": "and they save lives, they improve lives,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 46.833,
      "endSec": 48,
      "text": "they generate income,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 48,
      "endSec": 48.9,
      "text": "they create jobs,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 48.9,
      "endSec": 50.6,
      "text": "they boost the economy,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 50.6,
      "endSec": 52,
      "text": "they increase crop yields,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 52,
      "endSec": 54,
      "text": "they make airplane travel safer,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 54,
      "endSec": 56.6,
      "text": "they make train transportation safer."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 56.6,
      "endSec": 58.733,
      "text": "NASA's everywhere you look."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 58.733,
      "endSec": 60.2,
      "text": "One example I like to bring up"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 60.2,
      "endSec": 61.9,
      "text": "is the camera in your cell phone."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 61.9,
      "endSec": 64.1,
      "text": "That was actually developed at JPL."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 64.1,
      "endSec": 65.9,
      "text": "We were working on a lightweight,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 65.9,
      "endSec": 67.2,
      "text": "high resolution camera"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 67.2,
      "endSec": 69.2,
      "text": "for a satellite application,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 69.2,
      "endSec": 71.833,
      "text": "and that became the very first camera"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 71.833,
      "endSec": 73.6,
      "text": "on a chip, camera in the cell phone."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 74.3,
      "endSec": 75.6,
      "text": "We've also worked on things"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 75.6,
      "endSec": 76.933,
      "text": "like indoor agriculture,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 76.933,
      "endSec": 78.3,
      "text": "which is increasingly important"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 78.3,
      "endSec": 79.633,
      "text": "as the world gets denser"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 79.633,
      "endSec": 82.6,
      "text": "and people need access to healthy foods."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 82.6,
      "endSec": 83.533,
      "text": "During the pandemic,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 83.533,
      "endSec": 86.333,
      "text": "some researchers developed a ventilator"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 86.333,
      "endSec": 87.7,
      "text": "that had fewer than 100 parts,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 87.7,
      "endSec": 89.033,
      "text": "none of which were required"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 89.033,
      "endSec": 90,
      "text": "in the supply chain"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 90,
      "endSec": 91.2,
      "text": "to make other ventilators."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 91.2,
      "endSec": 93.033,
      "text": "We gave that to dozens of companies"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 93.033,
      "endSec": 95.7,
      "text": "all around the world to help save lives."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 95.7,
      "endSec": 98.466,
      "text": "If you check out spinoff.nasa.gov,"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 98.466,
      "endSec": 100.833,
      "text": "you can find thousands of examples"
    },
    {
      "startSec": 100.833,
      "endSec": 103.1,
      "text": "of how NASA is everywhere in your life."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 103.97,
      "endSec": 105.9,
      "text": "We Asked a NASA Technologist."
    },
    {
      "startSec": 105.9,
      "endSec": 109.966,
      "text": "NASA. A NASA 360 Production."
    }
  ]
}
